<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S5.T1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Comparison of the performance of different models on negation tasks and the general task across different CLIP architectures. Avg. denotes the average accuracy on CC-Neg <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">29</a>]</cite> and NegRefCOCOg <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a>]</cite>. Bold numbers indicate the best performance within each architecture group.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
